  "query_preview": "(Thursday through Sunday)...\nThere will be additional warming of high temperatures on Thursday\nfollowed by slight day-to-day changes through next weekend. High\ntemperatures on Thursday will be mostly 4 to 8 degrees above\naverage ranging from the mid 70s to lower 80s near the coast to\nthe mid 90s to 108 for the Inland Empire with 110 to 114 for the \nlower deserts. For Thursday through next weekend, there will be\nwidespread moderate or greater HeatRisk except near the coast and\nfor the higher elevations in the mountains with widespread major\nHeatRisk for the lower deserts.\n\nAn increase in monsoonal moisture late in the week could bring a \nslight chance of afternoon thunderstorms, mainly for the mountains\nand centered around Friday.",
